{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the decaying halls of Mortimer Manor, where every ticking second erodes your grip on reality. In <strong>Doomed Inheritance</strong>, you\u2019ll navigate grand foyers, shadowed galleries, and winding catacombs\u2014all while a relentless sanity meter displayed as a brain icon fractures under the strain.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sanity System:</strong> Watch your brain HUD icon crack and splinter as time slips away. When your mind falters, controls stutter and visuals distort, heightening the dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Secrets:</strong> Hunt for hidden alcoves, secret pantries, and forgotten journals that shed light on the Mortimer curse\u2014and grant fleeting relief in the form of youth vials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Presentation:</strong> Immerse yourself in hand\u2010crafted Gothic corridors, eerie soundscapes, and flickering candlelight that reveal\u2014or conceal\u2014the manor\u2019s darkest secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Content:</strong> Experience the opening chapters, from the grand staircase down to the relic\u2010filled catacombs. Future updates may expand the estate, introduce fresh puzzles, and deepen the narrative, guided by community feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to inherit centuries of ambition\u2014and pay the ultimate price? Your borrowed time begins now.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Voices in the Walls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893730/044b2ed95afd0540a19894123052374810ad0b4e.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodline Awakened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893730/17db35d32ffcf3411854640b0c24dfed86134a58.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle of the Damned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893730/cdeb87785f5935b02327337d53ab82b8926e48b7.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Inheritance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893730/1390f90a92c2b19e915b5d80e8a9647eee653f86.jpg"},{"name":"Echoes Remembered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893730/0bb6224224624588606c0fe28fe8e3f061b97817.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the Family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893730/b06501893c5032f86bd1b98b4cd33d44e8f24b26.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893730?t=1765645302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893730/a2406258b232021c4d5fd27b1dc12a7e6172c276/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765645302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893730/0bc73038dc2d72ddfa1a39b7ac864f5d6869ff6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765645302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893730/0bc73038dc2d72ddfa1a39b7ac864f5d6869ff6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765645302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the decaying halls of Mortimer Manor, where every ticking second erodes your grip on reality. In <strong>Doomed Inheritance</strong>, you\u2019ll navigate grand foyers, shadowed galleries, and winding catacombs\u2014all while a relentless sanity meter displayed as a brain icon fractures under the strain.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sanity System:</strong> Watch your brain HUD icon crack and splinter as time slips away. When your mind falters, controls stutter and visuals distort, heightening the dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Secrets:</strong> Hunt for hidden alcoves, secret pantries, and forgotten journals that shed light on the Mortimer curse\u2014and grant fleeting relief in the form of youth vials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Presentation:</strong> Immerse yourself in hand\u2010crafted Gothic corridors, eerie soundscapes, and flickering candlelight that reveal\u2014or conceal\u2014the manor\u2019s darkest secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Content:</strong> Experience the opening chapters, from the grand staircase down to the relic\u2010filled catacombs. Future updates may expand the estate, introduce fresh puzzles, and deepen the narrative, guided by community feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to inherit centuries of ambition\u2014and pay the ultimate price? Your borrowed time begins now.</p>","developers":["Orikazi"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893730/0ad81d244c78155a93c863b3b245466e1092b5cd/header.jpg?t=1765645302","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3893730/127024306/10baf1a5d65774bf54bd9d512152585c9fe52e98/1753383873/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753715855","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3893730/127024306/10baf1a5d65774bf54bd9d512152585c9fe52e98/1753383873/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753715855","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3893730/127024306/10baf1a5d65774bf54bd9d512152585c9fe52e98/1753383873/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753715855","id":257173114,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as